# Punish on shield: the dummy plays one of your Record slots 1-4 (its attack) each attempt; you shield it and punish.
# The trainer picks the slot by weight and moves weight to the attacks you punish worst.
name: Punish on shield
about: Record the dummy's attacks in Record slots 1-4 first. Shield, then hit it within 25 frames.
start: here
cpu: none
adapt: recording
options: rec1 rec2 rec3 rec4
weights: 4 4 4 4
trigger: user_shield
success: hit 25
par: 6
timeout: 360
loop: after 40
